5,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. Let's try to find the werewolf together while staying kind to one another. Does anyone have a suggestion on how we should start?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! I bet I can just feel who the bad guy is! Maybe we should all say something weird and see who reacts?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"That sounds like fun, Rin! I'll help you! Maybe the werewolf will get nervous and giggle if we start playing a game?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,That's inefficient. We should focus on speech patterns and logical inconsistencies. Emotional reactions are too subjective to be reliable evidence.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree with Shion, though perhaps with less rigidity. A balance of observation and rational deduction will be our best tool here.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Logic is important, but let's not forget to listen to each other. If someone feels uneasy, it might be a clue.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Exactly! My tummy always tells me when something is fishy. @Shion, you're being too serious! Lighten up a bit!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Yeah, Shion! If we're too serious, the werewolf will just hide better. Let's keep it breezy!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Being ""breezy"" is exactly how a werewolf blends in. I'll be observing how you two try to deflect the conversation.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,A fair point. The tension between intuition and logic often reveals the truth. I shall observe who pushes for which method.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I think we should be cautious. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they might be targeted.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Ooh, a secret agent! I love secrets! I'll protect the Seer with all my might!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,Me too! We can be the Seer's bodyguards! Who do you think is the most suspicious so far?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"It's too early for suspicions, but the eagerness of the younger ones is... interesting.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Over-enthusiasm can be a mask. However, we lack any concrete data at this moment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,Let's agree to watch for contradictions tomorrow. I hope we can all trust each other.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm gonna keep my eyes peeled! This is like a real adventure!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'll be looking for clues everywhere! Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,I will be analyzing every word. Let the night begin.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent approach. I look forward to the revelations of tomorrow.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
