36,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. I have some information, but I want to be careful about how I share it to protect the village.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Rin,,@Midori! Did you find something? Tell us! Tell us! Is there a scary wolf among us?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I wonder who it is! I hope it's not me, because I'm just a helpful little girl! Teehee!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Midori's hesitation is telling. She's likely the Seer. @Midori, if you know something, the village needs it now.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Shion is quick as always. However, revealing the Seer's identity immediately can be a risky gamble.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I don't want to cause panic, but I believe Sakura might be the one we are looking for.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! Sakura? But she's so cute! Are you sure, Midori? Maybe the wolf tricked you?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Me?! No way! Midori, why would you say that? I've been so nice! You're making a mistake!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A direct accusation from the likely Seer. Sakura's reaction is predictably emotional, which is a common defense mechanism.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If Midori is indeed the Seer, the evidence is binary. Unless Midori is the werewolf lying to frame Sakura.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Midori,,I promise I am telling the truth. I want us to win as a village.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Rin,,"This is so confusing! I want to believe Midori, but Sakura is my friend! What should we do?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm a villager! I swear! @Benjamin, you're smart, you know Midori is just confused, right?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,Sakura is attempting to recruit Benjamin's intellectual authority to validate her lie. It's a classic diversion.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a calculated plea. However, the Seer's role is specifically designed to provide this clarity. The logic favors Midori.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm sorry, Sakura, but for the safety of everyone, I have to stand by my divination.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll trust Midori... but I'm still sad! Let's just get this over with!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Sakura,,You're all mean! I can't believe you're listening to her! I'm innocent!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,Shion,,The evidence is sufficient. Logic dictates we remove the threat immediately.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
58,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
59,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. The probability of Midori lying as the Seer is lower than Sakura lying as the wolf.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
